{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da83b5ff68325d16dab0281e1cdd50ef33b55733eff445e0b990b421dc1213f2", "ja": "（ホタルを見るという企画で、歩と山に行ってきた。\nかなりの遠出だったが、なかなか楽しかったな）", "zh": "（由于有赏萤这个企划，我和步一起登山去了。\n虽然出了一趟远门，但旅程挺愉快的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d1ad5b6e86743f8595bb2aadfe25641a84305118e950d2c5b2e9b08037bcab5f", "ja": "はぁ、帰りがすっかり遅くなっちゃった……。\n{$P$}、今日はありがとな！", "zh": "唉，这么晚才回到这里……\n{$P$}，今天谢谢你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "71f1078e697bff911d4789ed395a02760f951d3e100695de2f3c0785a9d4aa77", "ja": "ちょっと山に登っただけで、あんなにホタルが\nいるんだな。全然知らなかったよ！", "zh": "我都不晓得原来爬一小段山，\n就能看到这么多的萤火虫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "648d8595d56f05d67309d196e3f53fdbe22355587b8b48915891c00d414f46fc", "ja": "アタシ、ついテンション上がっちゃって……あちこち\n連れ回しちゃったけど、大丈夫？　疲れてない？", "zh": "我一不小心就兴奋过头……\n拉着你到处跑，你还好吗？会不会累？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c9af573472c1ebe892898214cf9972c0d3fc94986e169db3a4c7f74ad77ccbd1", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。このくらいでヘバってたら、\n忙しいアイドルのプロデューサーは務まらないからな。", "zh": "不用担心，要是这样就嫌累，\n那我要怎么胜任繁忙的偶像制作人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8228d55e37605b9c41be0bca916b8f322ae868d79af6f0d1411d017592ea77de", "ja": "そっか、ならよかったよ。アタシも楽しかった！\n山は遠かったけど、がんばって行ったかいがあったよ。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。我也玩得很开心！\n虽然到很远的地方爬山，但这趟辛苦是值得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9710e75de188e010c6c35a33a5ba17e164fcb8eac3b09121793baac5ed44fdbf", "ja": "ホタルの光がキラキラして、ライブ会場みたいだった。\nあんなキレイな景色が見られるなんてさ……♪", "zh": "萤火虫闪闪发光的样子，就像演唱会的会场。\n没想到可以看到那么漂亮的景象……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1007_p", "source_sha256": "858df43adf643edda06d6bdc8fd3b4499aa1c11ef5b09166a2571ed41c0e4100", "ja": "ライブ会場みたいか……確かにな。頑張って\nトップに立てば、違う綺麗な景色が見られるもんな。", "zh": "像演唱会的会场……说得对，\n只要努力站上颠峰，就能看到不同的美景呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4ea2d99623f2b69d8422ee1747ce0bc57f85bdc904dda9e112e5dcf642badbb0", "ja": "{$P$}、いいコト言うじゃん！　そう\nだよ、てっぺんに立てば最高の景色が見られるんだ。", "zh": "{$P$}，这话说得漂亮！\n一点也没错，站上最高的地方就能看到最棒的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "857fe0a4c7a28b5a069c22c8baf97c26241dc7ef1483cd53ebe2ca7fc97497eb", "ja": "山は山でも、アタシが目指すのはアイドルの\nナンバー・ワン！　そこんとこ、忘れないでよね！", "zh": "虽然同样是爬上巅峰，但我的目标是偶像的No.1！\n这你可千万别忘啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1010_p", "source_sha256": "53b3d8e9fe663a3a38fe7604ada505fc80b331cbbf8635da3d1630beb2d507ba", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n……それより歩、帰らなくていいのか？", "zh": "嗯，这是当然的。\n……是说步，你还不用回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a35dffc00d5ffe4a62d18ecf7ed577aed754d57237e102e34d4e08e7997d3a43", "ja": "えっ？　……うわっ、もうこんな時間！？\n早く帰らないと、明日の朝早いんだった～！", "zh": "咦……哇！居然这么晚了！？\n我得快点回去，明天还要早起呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1b9b147fa3158c6449b0179e9ff60e24b164c3e708d94a7054ef1f9d0dc587b9", "ja": "やっぱり……。\n危ないし、家まで送るよ。", "zh": "果然啊……\n夜路危险，我送你回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b7aadf494a35ed2fe31687b05e7d7d6d5e2c155b246a7948e72f584126ab9c5", "ja": "いいって、いいって！　それより、明日寝坊しそう\nだから、モーニングコールしてほしいな～なんて……。", "zh": "不用、不用！我更担心明天睡过头，\n想麻烦你打电话叫我起床～开玩笑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9f6a84b40d4f9804afae84cbb172ff42e25842e4934bf00c5fddefc24a14bda6", "ja": "モーニングコールか、わかった。\n時間は、7時でいいのか？", "zh": "打电话叫你起床啊，没问题。\n时间订在7点可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dbd4f779177f204ba7debfd8c2181c11ff0b0f035b4a5b0240b61cec63480968", "ja": "えっ、本当にしてくれるの！？　あっ、やっぱいいや！\nなんか、寝ぼけてヘンなコト言ったら困るし……。", "zh": "咦？你真的愿意吗！？啊，还是算了！\n我怕自己睡迷糊乱讲些奇怪的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0073_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b3add311c10a7bbcc0ff8e352cccca85d70678a346b0cd07b60abff49429699d", "ja": "{$P$}、今日はサンキュー！\n明日もよろしくな！　グッバーイ！", "zh": "{$P$}，今天谢谢你啦！\n明天也请多指教！Goodbye！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
